# Cursor & Codex Rules for Pointillism Studio

- Framework: React 19 + TypeScript + Vite 6 + Tailwind CSS v4.
- Primary App Code: src/App.tsx
- Styling: Use Tailwind CSS utility classes and the theme variables defined in src/index.css (--color-bg-main, --color-bg-panel, --color-accent-blue, etc.).
- Performance: Keep canvas rendering non-blocking. Use progressive batching via requestAnimationFrame when drawing heavy point distributions.
- State: PointSettings interface in src/App.tsx controls all drawing properties. Maintain backwards compatibility for preset saving/loading.
- Clipboard: Maintain Ctrl+V / Cmd+V paste support for direct image import.
